WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.520
Lunar Pool is the first advanced home video billiards game ever!

00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:09.120
Never before has the player been able to choose among 60 different tables.

00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:13.240
Jump around to your favorite or master each stage consecutively.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.200
Your score is kept automatically.

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:20.740
You set up the electronic cue stick, aim the cue ball, choose the power you need, and shoot!

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:24.800
Then watch the ball ricochet around the table and land in the pocket.

00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:28.960
Learn to be a hustler by mastering all 60 stages.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:51.500
Node-

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:54.260
