00:29:52.000 --> 00:29:52.860
Like it,

00:29:53.060 --> 00:29:55.100
it probably will do well

00:29:55.100 --> 00:29:56.380
on the regular,

00:29:56.780 --> 00:29:57.780
uh, board,

00:29:57.920 --> 00:29:59.140
the, I'm sorry, the regular,

00:29:59.140 --> 00:30:00.800
uh, pool table

00:30:00.800 --> 00:30:02.140
because it understands

00:30:02.140 --> 00:30:03.020
basic,

00:30:03.300 --> 00:30:05.780
um, it understands basic,

00:30:05.780 --> 00:30:06.820
uh, angles

00:30:06.820 --> 00:30:08.520
and how to get a,

00:30:08.620 --> 00:30:10.360
a ball into a hole,

00:30:10.380 --> 00:30:12.540
but it never really handles

00:30:12.540 --> 00:30:13.440
any of the,

00:30:13.460 --> 00:30:16.000
the wackier models very well.

00:30:16.000 --> 00:30:18.040
Like I saw the computer

00:30:18.040 --> 00:30:19.460
actually shoot it directly

00:30:19.460 --> 00:30:20.720
into a hole once

00:30:20.720 --> 00:30:22.060
