00:32:22.000 --> 00:32:23.660
High scores don't mean anything when it's your own.

00:32:24.620 --> 00:32:25.420
Couch multiplayer

00:32:25.420 --> 00:32:26.620
usually improves

00:32:26.620 --> 00:32:28.400
an experience, at least in total.

00:32:29.460 --> 00:32:31.200
All right. If there's no other

